{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","祈雨"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","기우제"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","持续施法，每秒治疗所有友方单位的生命值。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","지속적으로 시전하며, 초당 모든 아군 유닛의 HP를 치료한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","持续施法9秒，每秒为所有友方单位回复-95% − 5% ATK的生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","시전이 9초간 지속되며, 초당 모든 아군 유닛의 HP를 -95% − 5% ATK만큼 회복시킨다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":31,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每秒的回复量提升至伊温-100% − 5% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","초당 회복량이 휴윈의 -100% − 5% ATK까지 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":25,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每秒的回复量提升至伊温-105% − 5% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","초당 회복량이 휴윈의 -105% − 5% ATK까지 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":17,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"st